        agents and DNA topoisomerase II inhibitors.\", \"volume\": \"14\", \"year\":
        2004}, {\"abstract\": \"A number of substituted piperazinyl oxazolidinone
        derivatives have been synthesized and their antibacterial activities were
        evaluated by MIC determination. A systematic SAR was carried out to get highly
        potent oxazolidinone derivatives.\", \"authors\": \"Lohray BB, Lohray VB,
