        \"doi_chembl\": null, \"first_page\": \"309\", \"issue\": \"2\", \"journal\":
        \"Bioorg Med Chem Lett\", \"journal_full_title\": \"Bioorganic & medicinal
        chemistry letters.\", \"last_page\": \"312\", \"patent_id\": null, \"pubmed_id\":
        14698147, \"src_id\": 1, \"title\": \"Synthesis of potent and selective 2-azepanone
        inhibitors of human tryptase.\", \"volume\": \"14\", \"year\": 2004}, {\"abstract\":
        \"In our search for a novel class of inducible nitric oxide synthase (iNOS)
